{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "762fef46-30aa-4695-b9df-412f597ae688", "team_id": "contest2026_174_lvmoushouhuzhe", "github_login": "Joneyao", "tool": "kiro", "seq": 47, "ts": "2026-07-21T10:54:00.428Z", "role": "user", "text": "static int esp_dsi_fb_demo_worker(int argc, FAR char *argv[])\n{\nuint8_t *fb;\nsize_t fb_size;\nbool show_red = true;\n(void)argc;\n(void)argv;\nfb = esp_lcd_dpi_panel_get_fb(g_dpi_panel);\nfb_size = esp_lcd_dpi_panel_get_fb_size(g_dpi_panel);\nif (fb == NULL || fb_size == 0)\n{\nsyslog(LOG_ERR, \"[DSI-FB] Demo thread: framebuffer unavailable\\n\");\nreturn -EINVAL;\n}\nwhile (1)\n{\nif (show_red)\n{\nfill_framebuffer(fb, fb_size, 0xff, 0x00, 0x00);\nsyslog(LOG_INFO, \"[DSI-FB] Demo color: red\\n\");\n}\nelse\n{\nfill_framebuffer(fb, fb_size, 0x00, 0x00, 0xff);\nsyslog(LOG_INFO, \"[DSI-FB] Demo color: blue\\n\");\n}\nesp_cache_msync(fb, fb_size, ESP_CACHE_MSYNC_FLAG_DIR_C2M);\nshow_red = !show_red;\nusleep(2000000);\n}\nreturn 0;\n} \n这个fb 指针，对应的是显存吗? 详细梳理一下这个fb 指针 与最终显示的地址的关系"}
